  message: "Merged in dev as d094b09678 (PR #3734).\n\nImplementation:\n- New module: packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/_third_party_bases.py (84 stmts, 100% coverage).\n- Linker: `django-third-party-dispatch`, priority 23, activation `LinkerActivation(frameworks=[\"django\"])`.\n- Method table THIRD_PARTY_BASE_METHODS covers four framework families:\n  - HierarkeyForm (Form lifecycle + save)\n  - FilterSet / WagtailFilterSet (filter_queryset, qs, get_form_class, get_filters, is_valid)\n  - Serializer / ModelSerializer / HyperlinkedModelSerializer (DRF lifecycle: to_representation, to_internal_value, validate, run_validation, save, get_fields, etc. + ModelSerializer-only create/update/build_*_field)\n  - Page (Wagtail: serve, route, get_template, get_context, get_url_parts, etc.)\n- INV-zuhub discipline preserved (confidence ≤ 0.5 + meta[\"disambiguation_fallback\"]=True on unqualified short-name matches with in-tree collisions).\n- ModelAdmin excluded — already covered by django_orm_dispatch (errata recorded in WI-jusih data-pass report).\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- AC-1 (HierarkeyForm forms.Form-style dispatch): satisfied. Pretix smoke test produced 8 dispatches_to edges from SettingsForm-rooted classes (clean/save overrides).\n- AC-2 (FilterSet, DRF Serializer, Wagtail Page, ModelAdmin): partially satisfied. Pretix produced 27 DRF Serializer edges + 0 FilterSet edges (pretix FilterSets declarative-only) + 0 Page edges (no Wagtail). Lutris-website produced 3 additional DRF Serializer edges. ModelAdmin coverage retained in django_orm_dispatch (unchanged).\n- AC-3 (non-Django repo emits zero edges): satisfied. Framework activation gate is a hard cutoff — verified by 4 TestFrameworkActivation tests + smoke test on bakerydemo (where the orthogonal framework-detector bug prevents `django` detection, so the linker correctly does not fire).\n- AC-4 (100% coverage): satisfied (84/84 statements).\n\nBakeoff validation pending — tagged `awaits_bakeoff_validation`. Direct UAT verification will need:\n1. A repo that triggers Wagtail Page rescues (bakerydemo blocked by framework-detector bug)\n2. A repo with HierarkeyForm-like chains (pretix already covered above)\n3. A repo with FilterSet method overrides (most are declarative)\n4. A DRF-heavy repo (lutris confirms ~3 edges)\n\nData-pass errata at ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/wi-jusih-data-pass-20260515/ERRATA.md records the method-override-filter correction (175 → ~40 method-edges) and ModelAdmin double-count exclusion.\n\nNote: a follow-up bug should be filed for the framework detector's recursive manifest scan not following `-r` includes (only matches files literally named requirements.txt, missing requirements/base.txt layouts that bakerydemo and many django apps use)."  # f537
